<div id="pf7c" class="pf w1 h5" data-page-no="7c"><div class="pc pc7c w1 h5"><img class="bi x10 ye46 w4 h18c" alt="" src="bg7c.png"/><div class="c x0 y0 w3 h5"><div class="t m0 x101 h7 y1b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">123 </div><div class="t m0 xb hd y42 ff2 fs8 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Lekcja 11<span class="ls12">. </span><span class="ff3">–<span class="ff4"> <span class="_ _c"></span>Jaka dzisiaj pogoda<span class="_ _7"></span>? </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 he y43 ff4 fs9 fc3 sc0 ls0 ws0">_<span class="fc0">I. Prognoza pogody</span>_<span class="_ _9"></span><span class="fc0"> </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y44 ff7 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1. Proszę powiedzieć, jaka zwykle bywa pogoda w te święta.<span class="ff4"> </span></div><div class="t m0 x9b h7 y50e ff3 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Wielkanoc     Boże Narodzenie     Andrzejki     Walentynki      Boże Ciało     <span class="ff2">twoje urodziny </span></div><div class="t m0 xb8 h7 ye47 ff3 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Wszystkich Świętych<span class="ff2">     </span>Święto Konstytucji     Święto<span class="ff2"> </span>Niepodległości<span class="ff2">     Nowy Rok </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y22 ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2<span class="ff7">. Proszę uzupełnić zdania</span> wyrazami z ramki. </div><div class="t m0 x69 h7 ye48 ff3 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">słońce     burz<span class="ff2">y     </span>gwiazda     chmura     śnieg     mgła     wiatr     deszcz     błyskawica<span class="ff2"> </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 h7 y3b2 ff3 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">WZÓR: <span class="ff6">Wczoraj były głośne grzmoty i jaskrawa <span class="ffb">błyskawica<span class="ff5">.<span class="ff2"> </span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x123 h10 y449 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Weź ze sobą parasol, cały czas pada .......................... .</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x123 h10 ye49 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Dzisiaj nie ma słońca, na niebie są same ..............</span></span>.............. .  </div><div class="t m0 x123 h10 ye4a ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Nic nie widzę! Jest bardzo gęsta  ................................... .</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x123 h10 ye4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Gdy spada .............................. trzeba pomyśleć życzenie. </span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x123 h10 ye4c ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span></span>W Warszawie wieje dzisiaj silny ....................... .  </div><div class="t m0 x123 h10 ye4d ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Lubię, kiedy zimą pada ................</span></span>....... . </div><div class="t m0 x123 h10 ye4e ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Latem zawsze jest gorąco i świeci .............................. .</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x123 h10 ye4f ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">8.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Boję się .......................... z piorunami.</span></span> </div><div class="t m0 x7 ha ye50 ff7 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">♫<span class="ff4"> 3</span>. Proszę posłuchać i zaznaczyć, gdzie <span class="ff4">jest </span>prawda (P), a gdzie fałsz (F).<span class="ff4"> </span></div></div><div class="c x106 ye51 w80 h1a"><div class="t m0 x1c h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c xef ye51 w77 h1a"><div class="t m0 x12 ha y4b ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">P </div></div><div class="c x163 ye51 w76 h1a"><div class="t m0 x12 ha y4b ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">F </div></div><div class="c x106 y404 w259 h1a"><div class="t m0 x12 h10 y4b ff5 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">0.<span class="fff"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff6">Jesienią często pada deszcz, więc pan </span></span>Kowalski nie chodzi na spacery. </div></div><div class="c xef y404 w77 h1a"><div class="t m0 x3f h7 y3b9 ff10 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">✓<span class="ff2"> </span></div></div><div class="c x163 y404 w76 h1a"><div class="t m0 x79 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c x106 ya7c w259 h1a"><div class="t m0 x12 h10 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Kobieta nie lubi zimy, ponieważ wtedy jest zimno.</span></span> </div></div><div class="c xef ya7c w77 h1a"><div class="t m0 x79 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c x163 ya7c w76 h1a"><div class="t m0 x79 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c x106 y553 w259 h1a"><div class="t m0 x12 h10 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Pan Kowalski woli spędzać urlop w górach.</span></span> </div></div><div class="c xef y553 w77 h1a"><div class="t m0 x79 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c x163 y553 w76 h1a"><div class="t m0 x79 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c x106 y71f w259 h1a"><div class="t m0 x12 h10 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ff3">Pan Kowalski uważa, że nad morzem jest brzydko.</span></span> </div></div><div class="c xef y71f w77 h1a"><div class="t m0 x79 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c x163 y71f w76 h1a"><div class="t m0 x79 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c x106 ye52 w259 h3a"><div class="t m0 x12 h10 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span></span>Pan Kowalski mieszka niedaleko Zakopanego. </div></div><div class="c xef ye52 w77 h3a"><div class="t m0 x79 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c x163 ye52 w76 h3a"><div class="t m0 x79 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div></div><div class="c x0 y0 w3 h5"><div class="t m0 x7 ha ye53 ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">4<span class="ff7">. Proszę przeczytać i uzupełnić dialog</span> wyrazami z ramki<span class="_ _4"></span>.  </div></div><div class="c x7 y9b0 w228 h1a"><div class="t m0 x111 h7 y4b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">zimno     <span class="ff3">śnieg     jesień     temperatura     pogoda     mroźno     wiosna     pory     lato</span> </div></div><div class="c x0 y0 w3 h5"><div class="t m0 x7 ha ye54 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Andrzej<span class="ff3">: Miałaś rację, w górach jest bardzo pięknie.<span class="ff2"> </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y867 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Helena<span class="ff2">: Tak, ale czy nie jest wam </span>zimno</div><div class="t m0 x8f h18 ye55 ff2 fsb fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">0</div><div class="t m0 x76 h7 y867 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">? </div><div class="t m0 x7 h7 y868 ffb fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Paweł<span class="ff3">: Mamo, ja mam ciepły sweter i kurtkę, a jest lato!<span class="ff2"> </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y869 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Kasia<span class="ff2">: Lato? Co to znaczy? </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y89d ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Andrzej<span class="ff3">: Po polsku mówimy, że są cztery .........................................</span></div><div class="t m0 x131 h18 ye56 ff2 fsb fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1</div><div class="t m0 xd h7 y89d ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">, czyli cztery sezony. </div><div class="t m0 x7 h15 y86b ffb fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Paweł<span class="ff3">: Ja wie<span class="_ _7"></span>m, jak się nazywa<span class="_ _7"></span>j<span class="_ _4"></span>ą. Teraz <span class="_ _7"></span>jest lato, potem ...........................</span></div><div class="t m0 xa0 h18 ye57 ff2 fsb fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> 1</div><div class="t m0 x145 h7 y86b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">, z<span class="_ _7"></span>im<span class="_ _4"></span>a i <span class="_ _7"></span>.........................</div><div class="t m0 xf1 h18 ye57 ff2 fsb fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> 3</div><div class="t m0 x59 h7 y86b ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">. </div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y86c ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Andrzej<span class="ff3">: Świetnie!<span class="ff2"> </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y86d ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Kasia<span class="ff2">: Teraz jest ...........................</span></div><div class="t m0 x104 h18 yb35 ff2 fsb fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">4</div><div class="t m0 x61 h7 y86d ff3 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">, a ja mam na sobie kurtkę! Czy to je<span class="_ _c"></span>st normalne?<span class="ff2"> </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y89f ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Helena<span class="ff3">: Tak, bo w górach zwykle jest zimn<span class="ff2">o i ..............................</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x107 h18 ye58 ff2 fsb fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">5</div><div class="t m0 xe3 h7 y89f ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> <span class="ff3">szybko się zmienia.</span> </div><div class="t m0 x7 h15 y1ea ffb fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Paweł<span class="ff3">: Mama <span class="_ _7"></span>myślała, ż<span class="_ _7"></span>e będzie <span class="_ _7"></span>padać ..........................</span></div><div class="t m0 xf5 h18 y1eb ff2 fsb fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">6</div><div class="t m0 xd7 h7 y1ea ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> <span class="ff3">i <span class="_ _7"></span>w plec<span class="_ _7"></span>aku ma <span class="_ _7"></span>czapkę, rękawiczki <span class="_ _7"></span>i szalik.<span class="ff2"> </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y8a0 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Helena<span class="ff2">: I parasol. </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y884 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Kasia<span class="ff3">: Mamo, byłaś w Bieszczadach w zimie? Je<span class="_ _c"></span>stem ciekawa, jaka tu .....<span class="ff2">........................</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11d h18 yb39 ff2 fsb fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">7</div><div class="t m0 x11e h7 y884 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> w zimie. </div><div class="t m0 x7 ha ye59 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Helena<span class="ff3">: Tak. Pamiętam, że kiedy miałam 7 lat, byłam z rodzicami na feriach w Bieszc<span class="_ _c"></span>zadach.<span class="ff2"> </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y626 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Kasia<span class="ff2">: Na feriach? Co to znaczy? </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y8a3 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Helena<span class="ff2">: Ferie to takie wakacje, ale w zimie. </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y16c ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Kasia<span class="ff3">: I jaka była pogoda? <span class="ff2"> </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y2c1 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Helena<span class="ff3">: Było bardzo ....<span class="ff2">..........................</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x157 h18 y386 ff2 fsb fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">8</div><div class="t m0 xe1 h7 y2c1 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">, chyba -20 stopni Celsjusza. </div><div class="t m0 x7 ha y2c2 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Andrzej<span class="ff3">: To dobrze, że jest lato, bo ja nie lubię, kiedy jest mniej niż 10 stopni –<span class="ff2"> </span>oczywiście +10!<span class="ff2"> </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7 ha ye5a ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Helena<span class="ff3">: Dobrze, to nie rozmawiamy już o pogodzie, tylko robimy rodzinne zdjęcie!<span class="ff2"> <span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="fc4 sc0"> </span></span></span></div></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
